y"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years in all. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, October to November came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years. In 2025, November to December finished at 40% of normal on the middle, and in 2026 so far May to June came in at 207%.</p>"}
